  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and conservative turn recovery is enforced on obstacles. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and obstacle recovery is minimal but reliable.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model robot's motion and perception as a single plant automaton with all controllable and uncontrollable events.",
